Scope of this license

The MIT license above covers only the original work in this repository: the
tools, tests, build scripts, documentation, names, labels, and comments
written by the project's contributors.

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights in, the game itself. The assembly in
src/ is a disassembly of Dragon Warrior Monsters 2: Cobi's Journey, and the
code, data, graphics, text, and audio it reproduces remain the property of
their respective rights holders. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by them. The repository does not contain the game ROM; you must
supply your own copy to build.
